Implemented deterministic per-sample size model selection for wafer_particles generation and recorded `size_model`/`size_params_json` in samples while keeping single-model behavior intact.
Using S20_HYDRA_CONFIG, S40_PROCESS_IMPLEMENTATION, S70_VISUALIZATION_DS, S98_GOVERNANCE to keep config/process/viz expectations/tests aligned.

- `src/synthlab/processes/generate.py`: adds selection planning for `size_models.selection`, per-model param sampling, per-sample resolution, and sample metadata columns for size model tracking (including streaming headers).
- `src/synthlab/processes/doctor.py`: validates selection mode/ratios/models plus per-model size configs and `by_label` overrides.
- `src/synthlab/cli/main.py`: applies clamp defaults across selection models.
- `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/schema.py` and `docs/04_ARTIFACTS_AND_VERSIONING.md`: document optional sample columns for size model tracking.
- `tests/test_T0702_size_model_selection.py`: adds ratio allocation + determinism coverage for mixed size models.

